{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23379","headline":"和微之诗二十三首 和我年三首 二 · 白居易","name":"和微之诗二十三首 和我年三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我年五十七，归去诚已迟。\n历官十五政，数若珠累累。\n野萍始宾荐，场苗初絷维。\n因读管萧书，窃慕大有爲。\n及遭荣遇来，乃觉才力羸。\n黄纸诏频草，朱轮车载脂。\n妻孥及仆使，皆免寒与饥。\n省躬私自媿，知我者微之。\n永怀山阴守，未遂嵩阳期。\n如何坐留滞，头白江之湄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23379.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23379","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}